Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,A customer is reading a book near the shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,一位顧客正在書架附近看書。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:06.69,English,,0,0,0,,The display has no books on the shelves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:06.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,顯示幕上的書架上沒有書籍。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.09,0:00:10.06,English,,0,0,0,,The bookstore is crowded with patrons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.09,0:00:10.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,書店裡擠滿了顧客。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:13.75,English,,0,0,0,,The woman is checking a label on a book cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:13.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,這位女士正在檢查一本書封面上的標籤。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:17.25,English,,0,0,0,,You just released a new movie, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:17.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,你剛發行了一部新電影，不是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.65,0:00:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, it came out very recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.65,0:00:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,是的，它最近才出來。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:24.05,English,,0,0,0,,The painting is on display at the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:24.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,這幅畫正在博物館展出。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:27.21,English,,0,0,0,,It will go up for auction this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:27.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,它將於本週進行拍賣。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:30.54,English,,0,0,0,,When will the marathon be taking place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:30.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,馬拉鬆比賽什麼時候舉辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.94,0:00:33.26,English,,0,0,0,,It's being held in March.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.94,0:00:33.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,它於三月舉行。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,I've never run a marathon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我從來沒有跑過馬拉松。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:38.74,English,,0,0,0,,It took place a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:38.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,事情發生在一年前。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.14,0:00:42.53,English,,0,0,0,,How much of the concert proceeds are going to charity?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.14,0:00:42.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,演唱會的收益有多少會捐給慈善機構？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:45.83,English,,0,0,0,,The singer is proceeding backstage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:45.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,歌手正在後台進行。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.23,0:00:49.35,English,,0,0,0,,I believe it's about half of all proceeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.23,0:00:49.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我相信這大約是所有收益的一半。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.75,0:00:53.21,English,,0,0,0,,She donates money to charity every Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.75,0:00:53.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她每年聖誕節都會捐款給慈善機構。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.61,0:00:58.38,English,,0,0,0,,Questions 59 to 61 refer to the following conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.61,0:00:58.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,問題59至61涉及以下對話。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.78,0:01:06.37,English,,0,0,0,,The exhibition is set to open next week. We've been working on it for weeks and still haven't got everything ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.78,0:01:06.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,該展覽定於下週開幕。我們已經為此工作了數週，但仍未準備好一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:10.94,English,,0,0,0,,The only major thing to take care of is getting the displays set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:10.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,唯一需要注意的主要事情是設定顯示器。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:18.42,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, but finding a reliable mover who can move so many different types of art safely is proving to be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:18.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,是的，但事實證明，找到一個可以安全搬運如此多不同類型藝術品的可靠搬運工是很困難的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:29.14,English,,0,0,0,,I understand that. Pietro's incorporation of various forms of media into one piece of art makes his works unique, but incredibly difficult to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:29.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我明白這一點。彼得羅將各種形式的媒體融入藝術作品中，這使得他的作品獨一無二，但又極其難以移動。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:32.26,English,,0,0,0,,I really don't know who we should turn to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:32.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我真的不知道我們該向誰求助。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.66,0:01:40.55,English,,0,0,0,,Maybe try talking to Betty in Acquisitions. She's had lots of experience with unusual pieces in exhibitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.66,0:01:40.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,也許嘗試與收購部門的貝蒂交談。她對於展覽中不尋常的作品有著豐富的經驗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.95,0:01:47.58,English,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea. I can't believe I didn't think of that myself. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.95,0:01:47.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,這是個好主意。我不敢相信我自己沒有想到這一點。謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:51.07,English,,0,0,0,,When will the exhibition be taking place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:51.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,展覽什麼時候舉行？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.47,0:01:53.39,English,,0,0,0,,In two days
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.47,0:01:53.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,兩天後
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.79,0:01:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,In one week
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.79,0:01:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,一星期內
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:01:57.94,English,,0,0,0,,In two weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:01:57.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,兩週後
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:02:00.30,English,,0,0,0,,In a few days
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:02:00.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,幾天後
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,Why is the woman looking for a specific service?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,該女士為何尋求特定服務？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:08.11,English,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have experience moving display pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:08.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她沒有移動展示品的經驗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:11.54,English,,0,0,0,,There are multiple forms of art to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:11.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,有多種形式的藝術可供移動。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:14.94,English,,0,0,0,,The last moving company has closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:14.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,最後一家搬家公司已經關門了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:18.58,English,,0,0,0,,Their current movers are having vehicle trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:18.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他們目前的搬運工遇到了車輛問題。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:21.33,English,,0,0,0,,What does the man recommend?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:21.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,男人有什麼推薦？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:24.82,English,,0,0,0,,That the woman moves everything herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:24.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,女人自己移動一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:28.06,English,,0,0,0,,The woman should speak with a coworker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:28.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,該名女士應與同事交談。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.48,English,,0,0,0,,The woman should talk to the artist about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,女人應該和藝術家談談這件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:35.22,English,,0,0,0,,That the woman speaks with their previous movers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:35.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,該名女子與他們之前的搬家者交談過。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:39.82,English,,0,0,0,,Questions 80 to 82 refer to the following phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:39.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,問題80至82涉及以下電話。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.22,0:02:48.33,English,,0,0,0,,Hey, Frank. It's Gary. I just heard that the Rock Forever Concert next week has been canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.22,0:02:48.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,嘿，弗蘭克。是加里。我剛剛聽說下週的 Rock Forever 演唱會取消了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:56.79,English,,0,0,0,,Apparently, there was a pretty bad lightning storm last week near the stadium it was being held in and the electrical system was damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:56.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,顯然，上週舉辦比賽的體育場附近發生了一場相當嚴重的雷暴，電力系統遭到損壞。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:03:05.26,English,,0,0,0,,The concert has been postponed until they can repair the wiring. I called the ticket company, and now we have two choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:03:05.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,音樂會已推遲，直到他們能修復線路為止。我打電話給票務公司，現在我們有兩個選擇。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:12.69,English,,0,0,0,,We can either get full refunds on our tickets or we can hold onto them and wait until a new date for the concert is announced.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:12.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我們可以獲得門票的全額退款，也可以保留門票並等待音樂會的新日期公佈。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:21.58,English,,0,0,0,,If we wait, then when the concert has been rescheduled, we can get two free drinks from the drink stand. Let me know what you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:21.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,如果我們等待，那麼當音樂會改期時，我們可以從飲料攤得到兩杯免費飲料。讓我知道你想做什麼。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.98,0:03:24.26,English,,0,0,0,,What happened last week?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.98,0:03:24.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,上週發生了什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,The city was hit by a snowstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,這座城市遭受了暴風雪的襲擊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:30.03,English,,0,0,0,,There was a large storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:30.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,發生了一場大風暴。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:32.88,English,,0,0,0,,There was a severe earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:32.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,發生了強烈地震。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,An outbreak of a new virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,一種新病毒的爆發。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,Why has the concert been delayed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,演唱會為何延期？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,New speakers are being installed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,正在安裝新揚聲器。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:45.11,English,,0,0,0,,The seating was damaged in the stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:45.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,體育場內的座位損壞。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:48.22,English,,0,0,0,,Lightning damaged the power grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:48.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,雷電損壞了電網。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:51.53,English,,0,0,0,,The lead singer came down with a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:51.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,主唱得了感冒。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.93,0:03:56.15,English,,0,0,0,,What does the speaker mean when he says "Let me know what you want to do."?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.93,0:03:56.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,當說話者說「讓我知道你想做什麼」時，他的意思是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:59.50,English,,0,0,0,,His friend should call the ticket company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:59.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他的朋友應該打電話給票務公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,He wants his friend to make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他希望他的朋友做出決定。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:06.59,English,,0,0,0,,He is asking if his friend has some free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:06.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他問他的朋友是否有空閒時間。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.99,0:04:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,He is curious about their plans for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.99,0:04:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他很好奇他們今晚的計劃。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:17.62,English,,0,0,0,,Critics believed that the actress should have been nominated for outstanding performance because of her  role in her latest movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:17.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,評論家認為，這位女演員應該因為她在最新電影中的角色而獲得出色表演提名。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:19.48,English,,0,0,0,,she
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:21.25,English,,0,0,0,,her
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:21.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.65,0:04:23.33,English,,0,0,0,,herself
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.65,0:04:23.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她自己
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:25.22,English,,0,0,0,,hers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:25.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:33.82,English,,0,0,0,,Due to the high numbers of online subscriptions and low sales of printed media, the publication shifted to a purely digital format.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:33.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,由於線上訂閱量高而印刷媒體銷量低，該出版物轉向純數位格式。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.22,0:04:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,Due to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.22,0:04:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,由於
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.16,0:04:37.77,English,,0,0,0,,Ahead of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.16,0:04:37.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,領先於
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,Regardless of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,不管
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.56,0:04:42.58,English,,0,0,0,,In opposition to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.56,0:04:42.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,反對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.98,0:04:46.70,English,,0,0,0,,Metro Gallery to Hold Pierre Cousteau Exhibition
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.98,0:04:46.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,大都會畫廊將舉辦皮耶·庫斯托展覽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:49.21,English,,0,0,0,,by Marjorie Beckham
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:49.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,瑪喬麗貝克漢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.61,0:04:57.70,English,,0,0,0,,The Metro Gallery, located near City Hall, is set to hold an exhibition of various works from renowned artist Pierre Cousteau.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.61,0:04:57.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,位於市政廳附近的都會畫廊將舉辦著名藝術家皮耶·庫斯託的各種作品展。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:05:07.10,English,,0,0,0,,Representatives from the Metro Gallery said they are highly enthusiastic to be given the opportunity to display many of his works of art, both new and old.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:05:07.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,大都會畫廊的代表表示，他們非常高興有機會展示他的許多新舊藝術作品。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:15.27,English,,0,0,0,,Originally from Rochefort-en-Terre, Mr. Cousteau began to gain acclaim with his vivid landscape paintings in the realist style.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:15.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,庫斯托先生來自泰爾地區羅什福爾，他以寫實風格的生動風景畫開始贏得讚譽。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.67,0:05:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,Said to be able to capture even the smallest of details, Mr. Cousteau quickly rose to prominence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.67,0:05:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,據說庫斯托先生甚至能夠捕捉最微小的細節，因此很快就聲名鵲起。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:28.55,English,,0,0,0,,His earliest works have been known to fetch upwards of twenty million dollars when put up for auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:28.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,據了解，他最早的作品在拍賣時售價高達兩千萬美元。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:38.65,English,,0,0,0,,After becoming a household name in his native France, Mr. Cousteau later moved to the United States where he began to dabble in other forms of artistic expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:38.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,庫斯托先生在祖國法國家喻戶曉後，移居美國，開始涉足其他形式的藝術表現。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.05,0:05:48.41,English,,0,0,0,,His work with marble, while originally not as popular as his paintings, quickly gained fame once he began to create sculptures using abstract styling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.05,0:05:48.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他的大理石作品雖然最初不如他的繪畫那麼受歡迎，但一旦他開始使用抽象風格創作雕塑，就迅速聲名鵲起。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:55.94,English,,0,0,0,,Having recently finished an extensive renovation that replaced an aging electrical system and water drainage system,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:55.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,最近完成了大規模翻新，更換了老化的電力系統和排水系統，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:06:02.34,English,,0,0,0,,as well as overhauling its appearance, the Metro Gallery reopened to the public earlier this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:06:02.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,除了徹底改變外觀外，大都會畫廊在本月初也重新向公眾開放。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:10.85,English,,0,0,0,,Originally constructed in the early 1900s, the Metro Gallery began to fall into disrepair in the late 1980s.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:10.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,大都會畫廊最初建於 1900 年代初，但在 1980 年代末開始年久失修。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.25,0:06:19.05,English,,0,0,0,,A lack of high-profile artists and works, in addition to cut funding to maintain its appearance led to a decrease in patronage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.25,0:06:19.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,缺乏知名藝術家和作品，加上削減資金以維持其外觀，導致贊助量減少。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:28.47,English,,0,0,0,,However, the city government recently stepped in to provide the historic building with new funding in order to preserve the building and restore it to its former glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:28.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,然而，市政府最近介入，為這座歷史建築提供了新的資金，以保護這座建築並恢復其昔日的輝煌。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:36.50,English,,0,0,0,,Now officially recognized as a heritage site, funding for the Metro Gallery has been secured for the next thirty years,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:36.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,現在正式認定為遺產地，大都會畫廊在未來三十年的資金已得到保障，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:41.70,English,,0,0,0,,allowing it to host the works of famous artists, like Mr. Cousteau.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:41.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,使其能夠展出庫斯托先生等著名藝術家的作品。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:46.62,English,,0,0,0,,With a restored look to carry it forward into the twenty-first century,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:46.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,以修復的面貌帶入二十一世紀，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:53.66,English,,0,0,0,,the Metro Gallery now makes for the perfect venue for the breath-taking and awe-inspiring works of Pierre Cousteau.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:53.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,現在，Metro 畫廊成為展示皮埃爾·庫斯托 (Pierre Cousteau) 令人嘆為觀止、令人驚嘆的作品的完美場所。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:56.75,English,,0,0,0,,What is this article mainly about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:56.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,這篇文章主要在講什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:07:00.13,English,,0,0,0,,An art museum that is closing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:07:00.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,即將關閉的藝術博物館。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:03.67,English,,0,0,0,,An exhibition being held by a gallery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:03.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,畫廊正在舉辦的展覽。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:07.02,English,,0,0,0,,An artist trying to regain his fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:07.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,一位試圖恢復名譽的藝術家。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,A city trying to repair an old building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:10.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,一座試圖修復舊建築的城市。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,What is implied about Pierre Cousteau?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,皮埃爾·庫斯托暗示了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:17.56,English,,0,0,0,,He uses multiple forms of media for his art.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:17.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他在他的藝術中使用多種形式的媒體。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:21.82,English,,0,0,0,,He originally gained fame for his stylistic designs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:21.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他最初因其風格設計而聞名。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:25.78,English,,0,0,0,,He is from the United States and moved to France.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:25.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他來自美國，移居法國。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.18,0:07:29.22,English,,0,0,0,,His sculptures never became popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.18,0:07:29.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他的雕塑從未流行起來。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:33.85,English,,0,0,0,,According to the article, why did the gallery need to be remodeled?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:33.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,根據文章所述，為什麼畫廊需要改造？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.25,0:07:37.51,English,,0,0,0,,People complained about the confusing layout.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.25,0:07:37.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,人們抱怨佈局混亂。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:41.44,English,,0,0,0,,It was damaged by a recent natural disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,它因最近的自然災害而受損。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.84,0:07:44.98,English,,0,0,0,,It was showing its age due to lack of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.84,0:07:44.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,由於缺錢，它已經顯得很老舊了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:45.50,English,,0,0,0,,Vandals painted the exterior of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:45.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,破壞者粉刷了建築物的外部。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:54.54,English,,0,0,0,,In which of the following positions marked [1], [2],[3], and [4] does the following sentence best belong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:54.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,以下句子最適合標記為 [1]、[2]、[3] 和 [4] 的位置中的哪一個？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:08:01.47,English,,0,0,0,,"Said to be able to capture even the smallest of details, Mr. Cousteau quickly rose to prominence."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:08:01.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,“據說庫斯托先生甚至能夠捕捉到最微小的細節，他很快就聲名鵲起。”